<title>FINLAND: Clinton arrives in Helsinki for summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives in Helsinki for summit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton arrived in the Finnish capital on Thursday for a summit with Russian President Boris Yeltsin.</p>
<p>His plane touched down at Helsinki's Vantaa airport at 0950 GMT. Yeltsin was due to arrive later on Thursday before the summit's opening dinner. The main talks take place on Friday.</p>
</text>
